{"txn": 19, "events": [{"seq": 33, "kind": "package_stored", "payload": {"package_id": "dep-3e10544388", "item_id": "wi-73ff8400b3", "content_hash": "b6ab0d71a553b0a0873c3ffb90d41e9245e0f1707a2f2066e4d4b30d815c6953", "content_preview": "# 管理层简报：本周用户反馈分析\n\n**背景**：本周共收集 12 条用户反馈，经分析归纳为以下三条核心结论。\n\n**结论一：最新版本稳定性问题突出，但补丁已初见成效**\n部分用户反映更新后出现闪退、发热和耗电加快等问题，主要集中在打开聊天记录的场景。值得肯定的是，最新补丁发布后闪退已有明显好转，建议持续观察修复效果。\n\n**结论二：夜间模式体验不佳，存在可用性缺陷**\n有用户反馈夜间模式文字对比", "source_refs": [], "size": 465, "artifact_ref": "b6ab0d71a553b0a0873c3ffb90d41e9245e0f1707a2f2066e4d4b30d815c6953.txt", "stage": "submission", "submission_id": "submission-e657438d6f", "node_id": "node-3df43beb2d", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-16ddca608f"}, "ts": 1789045860.1282094}, {"seq": 34, "kind": "work_item_submitted", "payload": {"item_id": "wi-73ff8400b3", "submission_id": "submission-e657438d6f", "node_id": "node-3df43beb2d", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-16ddca608f", "output_sha256": "b6ab0d71a553b0a0873c3ffb90d41e9245e0f1707a2f2066e4d4b30d815c6953", "package_id": "dep-3e10544388"}, "ts": 1789045860.1285388}]}
